{'symbol': 'BALL', 'date': '2022-06-07 19:20:00', 'title': 'BALL CORPORATION RECOMMENDS REJECTION OF BELOW-MARKET MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL CORPORATION', 'text': "WESTMINSTER, COLO. , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BALL CORPORATION (NYSE: BALL) RECEIVED NOTICE TODAY OF AN UNSOLICITED MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL CORPORATION (TRC) TO PURCHASE UP TO 2,000,000 BALL COMMON SHARES, REPRESENTING APPROXIMATELY .63% OF THE COMPANY'S OUTSTANDING SHARES."}